# Wanix iframe isolation

Wanix **must** run in its own document, loaded via **iframe** (`src="/wanix.html"`), not in the same JS realm as the React cafe.

## Why

`wanix.min.js` pollutes the shared global namespace. Co-loading it on [`cafe/index.html`](../../cafe/index.html) alongside React/Vite/ZSS breaks or races the main app.

| Global / side effect | Risk |
|----------------------|------|
| `window.__wanix` | Wanix system registry |
| `window.Go` | Go `wasm_exec` injected into `<head>` at runtime |
| `customElements.define(...)` | Six Wanix tags — permanent, cannot unregister |
| `globalThis.list/read/write/bind/...` | DevTools helpers when `debug` is set |
| `window.WanixSocket`, AMD `require` (workbench) | More globals on `window` |

Separate document (iframe or navigation to `/wanix.html`) = clean `window` per realm.

## Three homes

| Home | Owns |
|------|------|
| [`zss/device/wanixclient/`](../../zss/device/wanixclient/) | Parent `wanixclient` device — UI state, bridge, room, zedcafe export |
| [`zss/device/wanixserver/`](../../zss/device/wanixserver/) | Iframe `wanixserver` device — handlers, `state.ts`, `runtime.ts`, `zedcafehost.ts` |
| [`zss/feature/wanix/`](../../zss/feature/wanix/) | Shared protocol/types/helpers only |

## Prohibited

- `<script src="…/wanix.min.js">` in [`cafe/index.html`](../../cafe/index.html) or any cafe React entry
- `<wanix-system>` (or other Wanix custom elements) in React/TSX under `cafe/`
- Importing Wanix iframe runtime (`zss/device/wanixserver/runtime`) into the Vite bundle for the main app
- **`<wanix-term>` elements** in [`cafe/wanix.html`](../../cafe/wanix.html) child orchestration — do not create, connect, or poll xterm via this tag

## Required

| Piece | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Canonical Wanix host | [`cafe/wanix.html`](../../cafe/wanix.html) — kernel, `<wanix-system>` tree, `<wanix-task>` / `<wanix-vm>` only |
| Iframe boot | [`cafe/wanix.ts`](../../cafe/wanix.ts) → `zss/device/wanixserver/runtime` + `zss/device/wanixserver` |
| Term I/O | `#task/<id>/term/data` and `#vm/…/term/data` **streams** (`openReadable` / `openWritable`) — not `<wanix-term>` |
| Term sizing | `_updateTerminals` shim + `termfit` RPC from parent (`WanixTermSizeSync`) |
| Cafe ↔ Wanix bridge | Parent: `screens/wanix/host` + `wanixclient/wanixbridge`; child: `wanixserver` device bus / `postMessage` |
| JSX types for Wanix tags | [`zss/feature/wanix/wanixelements.d.ts`](../../zss/feature/wanix/wanixelements.d.ts) — upstream typings only; runtime does not use `<wanix-term>` |

## Examples

```text
❌ BAD — wanix.min.js in index.html; WanixSystem in React tree
❌ BAD — createElement('wanix-term') + term.connect() for task/VM output
✅ GOOD — hidden iframe src="/wanix.html"; parent bridge in wanixclient/
✅ GOOD — connecttermsession on #task/<id>/term/data; termwrite/termfit RPC
✅ GOOD — direct visit /wanix.html for Wanix-only debugging
```
